        "narration": "Sam is building a fence. One whole fence has 10 boards. Here are the 10 boards.",
        "text": "1 fence = 10 boards",
        "visual": { "kind": "objects", "emoji": "🪵", "count": 10, "filled": null }
      },
      {
        "narration": "Sam paints 1 board. That is 1 out of 10. We call it one tenth. As a fraction it is 1/10. As a decimal it is 0.1.",
        "text": "1/10 = 0.1",
        "visual": { "kind": "ten-frame", "emoji": null, "count": null, "filled": 1 }
      },
      {
        "narration": "Now Sam has painted 5 boards. That is 5 tenths. It is 5/10, or 0.5. It is also one half of the fence!",
